<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent. She had no written directive. Today she completed a health care directive and has named a health care agent; a copy is now in the chart. She values independence and her ability to work above all. She wants full treatment for reversible illness, including hospital care. She would not want resuscitation or prolonged life support if she could no longer recognize people or make her own decisions. She will give copies to her agent and keep one at home. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
